    <string name="follo_disclosure_title">FOLLO Tracks uses your location</string>
    <string name="follo_disclosure_msg">FOLLO Tracks collects your phone\'s location, battery level and speed and sends them to Find Our Lost Loved Ones so search coordinators can see which ground has been covered and where searchers are.\n\nThis continues even when the app is closed or not in use, but FOLLO only keeps positions during declared search hours, inside the search area.\n\nNext, Android asks for location access.</string>
